%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%  CURVE SMOOTHING  %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

% Curve Smoothing Routines
%  Ernest Wood  -  Wed Apr 16 09:05:05 1986
%
%  These routines will ALWAYS create a smooth curve which
